xy &= 10\sqrt{2} \cdot 10\sqrt{2}-50-40\sqrt{2}-200-10\sqrt{2} \cdot (2\cdot 10\sqrt{2}+20) \\
&= 200-50-40\sqrt{2}-200-200-50 \\
&= \boxed{-250-40\sqrt{2}}
